<definition>c4(t) = (2.5*cos(t), 2.5*sin(t))</definition>
<definition>c5(t) = (3.0*cos(t), 3.0*sin(t))</definition>
<definition>gc(t) = (t, -1.5 - 0.25*t^2)</definition>
